mapping "Q658W.1" source="Q658W" target="205335008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Q658W SNOMED CT 205335008 = other specified congenital deformity of hip joint (Swedish
        extension of ICD-10 Q65.8). Target SNOMED CT 4006287 (code 205335008) =. Semantic 1:1 equivalence:
        both denote the residual bucket for congenital hip joint deformity. The base WHO ICD-10 Q65.8
        (concept_id 45558421) maps via Athena to SNOMED CT 201956 (Congenital anomaly of lower limb) — a
        broader parent — but is a closer, exact equivalent for this specific subconcept.
        """
}
mapping "Q741A.1" source="Q741A" target="156992000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Q741A SNOMED CT 156992000 = congenital genu valgum (knock knee), a Swedish subcode of Q74.1
        (Congenital malformation of knee). Target SNOMED CT 40322442 = (code 156992000). Exact 1:1 clinical
        equivalence. Note: base ICD-10 Q74.1 maps via Athena to the broader SNOMED CT 73872; the Swedish
        subcode is finer-grained and matches the specific valgus-deformity SNOMED CT concept.
        """
}
mapping "Q741B.1" source="Q741B" target="205341001" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Q741B SNOMED CT 205341001 = congenital genu varum (bow leg), a Swedish subcode of Q74.1.
        SNOMED CT has no concept explicitly named (the valgus counterpart 156992000 exists, but no
        symmetric varus sibling was found). Target SNOMED CT 4004959 = (code 205341001): closest defensible
        standard concept, semantically a -feeling but really exact-match-level residual since the source
        has no perfect SNOMED CT twin. High not because the target is NOS-level rather than varus-specific.
        Reviewer note: consider whether 73872 (broader) is preferred for merge consistency.
        """
}
mapping "Q741C.1" source="Q741C" target="61293001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Q741C SNOMED CT 61293001 = congenital patellar malformation, a Swedish subcode of Q74.1. No
        SNOMED CT concept for exists in the mirror; the closest specific concept found is 4204342
        (309244002), which is only one extreme of the source's heterogeneous scope (patellar hypoplasia,
        aplasia, dysplasia). Target SNOMED CT 73872 = (code 61293001) is the Athena-mapped parent of Q74.1;
        it legitimately subsumes all patellar malformations as knee-joint deformities. Broader, low
        confidence: subsumption is total but specificity loss is real.
        """
}
mapping "Q741X.1" source="Q741X" target="61293001" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Q741X SNOMED CT 61293001 = congenital knee malformation, unspecified. This is the Swedish
        unspecified-level subcode of Q74.1. Target SNOMED CT 73872 = (code 61293001), which is also the
        Athena crosswalk target for Q74.1. Exact clinical equivalence at the unspecified level: both
